(text "WINDLASS HOME ASSEMBLY. Through-hole and plug-in modules only. 100 x 100 mm, two layers.\\nThe v2 board and the firmware are unchanged. GPIO numbers are the existing map.\\nWatchdog is one CD74HCT14E. A 74HCT123 is not used: once CEXT is above 10 nF the retrigger\\ngap is about 0.42 of the pulse, so an 80 ms heartbeat cannot hold a 330 ms HCT123 high.\\nIsolation is functional. REED_RET, UP_RET, DN_RET and GND_CAN do not join GND or each other.\\nRelay contacts are dry and independent. Commons are not tied. Do not order from this sheet\\nuntil the first board has been measured." (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "e9e03636-1b24-43ca-b76d-64a1d29d07d1"))
